---
layout: base.njk
pagination: { data: stats.bots, size: 1, alias: b }
permalink: "/bots/{{ b.token | slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ b.token | name }} in robots.txt"
  description: "How many sites block {{ b.token | name }} ({{ b.operator }}), measured in robots.txt files."
---
<h1>{{ b.token | name }}</h1>
<p class="lede">{{ b.operator }} crawler, type: {{ b.category | cat }}.</p>
<ul class="tiles">
<li><strong>{{ b.mentioned | n }}</strong><span>sites name it in robots.txt</span></li>
<li><strong>{{ b.blocked | n }}</strong><span>block it fully ({{ b.pct_blocked_of_mentions }}%)</span></li>
<li><strong>{{ b.partial | n }}</strong><span>block some paths</span></li>
<li><strong>{{ b.allowed | n }}</strong><span>allow it explicitly</span></li>
</ul>
{% set i = botinfo[b.token] %}
<h2>About this crawler</h2>
{% if i and i.verified %}
<p>{{ i.purpose }}</p>
<dl class="facts">
{% if i.user_agent %}<dt>User-Agent</dt><dd><code>{{ i.user_agent }}</code>{% if i.user_agent_src %} <small>(third party: <a href="{{ i.user_agent_src }}" rel="noopener">source</a>)</small>{% endif %}</dd>{% endif %}
<dt>robots.txt token</dt><dd><code>{{ b.token }}</code></dd>
<dt>Respects robots.txt</dt><dd>{{ i.respects_robots }}{% if i.respects_robots_src %} <small>(third party: <a href="{{ i.respects_robots_src }}" rel="noopener">source</a>)</small>{% endif %}</dd>
{% if i.ip_ranges_url %}<dt>Published IP ranges</dt><dd><a href="{{ i.ip_ranges_url }}" rel="noopener">{{ i.ip_ranges_url }}</a></dd>{% endif %}
<dt>{% if i.source_type == "third_party" %}Source (third party, not confirmed by the operator){% else %}Operator page{% endif %}</dt><dd><a href="{{ i.doc_url }}" rel="noopener">{{ i.doc_url }}</a></dd>
</dl>
{% if i.notes.length %}<ul>{% for n in i.notes %}<li>{{ n }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
{% else %}
<p>No operator documentation found for this crawler. It is counted because sites name it in robots.txt.</p>
<p><code>{{ b.token }}</code></p>
{% endif %}
<p>Including sites that block it only through the <code>*</code> group, {{ b.eff_pct }}% of all sites with a robots.txt keep it out.</p>
<p><a href="/bots/">All AI crawlers</a></p>
